Z||000000||fropuff||12-04-2000||06:06 PM||||Hey, there is a kid in my class that is a VERY big talker.  He tells me every day how crappy the Fiero is.  He's a moron just for that.  Anyway, he has his license, and he is going to drive his mom's 1994 Ford Probe GT when she LETS him.  First of all, it's his mom's frickin car.  Second of all, it's TEAL!  No offense to anyone who likes teal, but I think teal cars are for those "special" group of males.  Again, no offense.  Third, I tell him that he has a 24V, supercharged 6-cylinder, and I have a 2.8L STOCK 6.  I don't know if it is, but he's such a moron and doesn't know either.  He knows that, but he still wants to race.  Maybe if I had a head start or something.  I keep telling him that the Fiero is awesome compared to the Probe (teal ones), and I challenged him to a race.  He thinks he will walk all over me.  He probably will, but not if I have my nitrous.  I asked him today what the Probe GT 0-60 time is, and he said 4.5 seconds!  What a frickin moron!  And it's an automatic!  I've also got an automatic, but when I have NOS, I want to WASTE this idiot.  How much will I beat him by?  I don't want to beat him just 0-60, but maybe 0-100?  I just want to waste the crap out of him.  I will then get a carpeted piece of plywood to cover the rear trunk, so he can't see the bottle.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||4
Z||000001||loafer87gt||12-04-2000||06:27 PM||||The newer probes have a 2.5 V6 in them. I think they put out around 160-164 Horsepower, and do the 0-60 in around 7.5 secs. One of my friends had a kicka$$ purplish silver one and it was a really close race. I took him off the start and led till around 60 MPH, but after that he had me in top end. I've been with him in the car when he had it going over 135 MPH. Mean top end on those things.||||reg||1
Z||000002||86SE||12-04-2000||06:44 PM||||I beat a turbo Probe to about 80, then the Fiero had to shift into 3rd gear, and after 2nd gear the fiero dosent have much ballz.  So I say race him with your stock 6 to 60 and you will probibly beat him, but to 100 I bet he will walk all over you.<P>PS - At 100 the 93 GT was about 3.5 car legnths ahead of me.<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero -- 3.4L CONVERSION IN PROGRESS --<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||1
Z||000003||fropuff||12-04-2000||07:30 PM||||So maybe I should use the nitrous??  I want to beat him HARD.  He wants to race me on a highway, but I don't really want to do that.  Too many things to go wrong, not a fair shot.  He's also a moron.  I knew that it was around 7 or 8 0-60 time, not bad as the Fiero is around 8 with a smaller engine.  It's not 4.5 though!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  What an idiot.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fformula88||12-04-2000||11:37 PM||||You may be able to give that PGT a decent run.  loafer is correct about the GT engine, its a 2.5L V6, 24 valves and puts out 164 HP @ 5600 RPM and 160 lbs-ft @ 4800.  A very capable engine.  Except it is an auto.  The 5-spds will do 0-60 in about 7.5, but the auto's are about a second to 1.5 sec more.  These put it very close in time to a V6 Fiero (my Formula atx did 0-60 in 8.75 sec this summer).  So he shouldn't blow you away.  Its a DOHC engine, so it isn't gonna run out of breath in the upper RPM range.  With nitrous you will beat him good.  But otherwise its going to be close!  Good luck.||||reg||1
Z||000005||wxxo||12-05-2000||04:10 PM|||| your little friend with the teal anal probe can stick it where the sun dont shine (if he hasnt already.) tell him that you want to race him in your grandpas truck and when the light turns green just run over his piece of **** . my mom drives a probe gt and i wouldnt piss on the damn thing if it was on fire. fieros rule! i think that you would beat him like it is (that is if i advocated street racing). besides fieros have enough style to make up for their other shortcomings. thats why we all keep them alive. thats my nickles worth of free advise. teal probe... haaaaaa! ||||reg||1
