Z||000008||Fformula88||12-05-2000||07:08 PM||||WOW!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  We sure are hostile towards the Probe!  I agree that a teal one is a lousy color, but I am gonna have to stick up for the Ford a little bit.  Probe's are good sport coupes.  They offer good to great handling and acceleration (depending on model/year/trim level).  I also particularly like the 2nd gen styling, especially with a spoiler on the rear (changes the looks of the whole car).  The Probe is also very reliable.  Its Mazda drivetrain is nearly bullit proof and lasts forever.  Don't get me wrong, I love my Fiero Formula and enjoy it everytime I get into it, but I enjoy my '97 Probe SE just as much!  (maybe because mine isn't teal!)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/Probe07.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
